1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The sixth process is <i>mengikis,</i>

2
00:00:04,024 --> 00:00:08,624
using a tool known as a scraper.

3
00:00:08,648 --> 00:00:13,148
The tool is triangular with
a pointed tip at the front,

4
00:00:13,172 --> 00:00:17,172
allowing it to effectively scrape at crevices

5
00:00:17,196 --> 00:00:21,196
such as the nooks and crannies

6
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:24,220
of the keris hilt.
